    (8,'ensemble','ExtraTreesClassifier','n_estimators=40, max_depth=6, random_state=42, n_jobs=1','Extra Trees randomize candidate thresholds in addition to feature selection. Stronger randomization changes the bias-variance balance rather than guaranteeing better accuracy.'),
    (9,'ensemble','AdaBoostClassifier','n_estimators=40, learning_rate=0.5, random_state=42','AdaBoost reweights examples after each weak classifier so later stages focus on errors. Label noise can receive excessive attention.'),
